  "description": "Ra-On is a top idol on professional hiatus after several scandals. During her time off, she’s tasked with training Ho-Rang, a member of a girl group on the verge of their debut. For reasons Ra-On cannot figure out, Ho-Rang is adamant on dropping out of her chance at stardom, and it’s up to Ra-On to get Ho-Rang’s singing and mindset back in the game. However, it isn’t easy to get Ho-Rang’s spirits and vocals high enough…until Ra-On discovers the perfect trick: pinching her in just the right place. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Bomtoon's and Lezhin's Jeonmunjing Ungni Danpyeonseon (전문직 웅니 단편선) Collection.*",
